 ["India has six physical divisions: the Northern Mountains (Himalayas), the Northern Plains, the Peninsular Plateau, the Thar Desert, the Coastal Plains and the Islands.","The Himalayas have snow-capped peaks and give rise to rivers like the Ganga. The Northern Plains are fertile.","The Western and Eastern Ghats lie along the coasts of the plateau."],
